<title>USA: Spreckels stake sold by Fleming group.</title>
<headline>Spreckels stake sold by Fleming group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Robert Fleming Inc, a New York-based investment adviser, said Friday that it sold its stake in Spreckels Industries Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 529,913 class A common shares of Spreckels on August 26 and 27 at prices ranging from $23.375 to $23.67 each, or $12.5 million.</p>
<p>The group said it also disposed of 2,250 shares as a gift.</p>
</text>
